                    "code": "\r\n// evi_softclip.gendsp by pete for evieve, cheap tanh()-like soft clipping, antialiased with a simple second-order Adaa\r\n\r\n// For more options, greater bandwidth and high-gain antialiasing, @see: \"evi_clipper.gendsp\" / [evi.clipper~] (more expensive).\r\n// For hard clipping only @see: \"evi_hardclip.gendsp\" / [evi.hardclip~].\r\n\r\n// see also: 'evi_adaa.genexpr'\r\nrequire(\"evi_clipping.genexpr\");\r\n\r\nout1 = adSc2(in1, 1, 0);\r\n\r\n\r\n",
